  id: GenreDivination
  title: Genre Divination
  author: thunder725
  description: '"Don''t worry, nobody understands what any of those words mean either."


    Listen to a music composition made of four instrumental tracks and determine how
    to name its music genre.


    Created by thunder725.


    Manual can be found at https://ktane.timwi.de/


    Includes full Twitch Plays and Ruleseed compatibility.


    =-= Version History =-=

    =-= 1.0.0

    - Initial Release


    =-= 1.1.0

    - Added a Stop Audio button


    =-= 1.1.1

    - Ruleseed 1: Changed Chords #1 from "Scatter" to "Blizzard" to avoid having two
    square-wave-sounding chords at once

    - Made Chords "Genius" louder and Bass "BehindLateAndWorseOff" quieter

    - Fixed bug where pressing the Play button 16 seconds after another Play while
    Audio was already playing would result in an un-Stoppable audio playing.'
  version: 1.1.1
  outputFolder: build
  debugBuild: 1
